<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Corinthia</para>
  <para style="toc1">CORINTHIA Mi-ngaidiang Paul Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Corinthia</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Cor</para>
  <para style="mt1">CORINTHIA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mi-ngaidiang Paul Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">2 Corinthia hi</char> Jisu Christa innei suonuk kum 55-56 pheiwei khan Tirton Paul in ileimajia eii (1:1). Hiwahi eini'n ninei khachu Paul in Corinthia koisuok diangnga imajia chemajia inni karra innihuuina kha eii. Kasing-kathei ngaikhan in-ngamna khachu matiang khan Paul in chikaom chemajia inkhat Corinthia ngaidiang aleimajia. Ama'n iril 2:3-4 hiwa chemajia imajia ngaikha inkhat-um neimakmijei. 2 Corinthia hi Paul in Mecedonia ah omlai imajia echa (2:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Hiwa 2 Corinthia hi minkhisik kaommak apumtakta ka-eii khat-um malung suungnga hongkasuok chemajia eii. Paul in Corinthia koisuok jarra Titus diangnga imu akatha chong jarra ama ratharokna kha amalar. Hiwa chemajia hin, Inzootna Kathar dungjuiya pesik jarra incheenna minchuna, halli Jerusalemma kaom kangamna ngai sannasik-ah sialrathai leisik hi Paul in akhoithenna iminchu kha eini'n nimu (8-9). Koisuok mi ka-emak akadikmak tirton lekkhat ngaikhan koisuok ah kaom mi lekkhat le Paul minhal nasik inthoa inmani minchuna kha minlok nasik inleitho kha ang. 2 Corinthia juohek siktiang khan inmani'n Paul thomatorna chungnga inngamsamna inleida, hiwa jarra lei-ete ama Jisu Christa tirton inkhat ena ama thomatorna kha ngartheiya kadik eii tia irilkha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paul in koisuok kha donna ama chemajia kha aleiphut <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:1-7">1:1-7</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Khawasuo Paul in ama sinasik chuonminsuuk ithon halli ama'n inmani jarra imu chong khat-um matiangnga ama chemajia chungnga inmani heimasang jarra iril <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:8-7:16">1:8–7:16</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Khawasuo, Jerusalemma kaom kangamna ngai sik-ah sialrathai jarra Paul in minchuna inei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1–9:15</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ajuohekna ah, Paul in ama tirton ena jarra inngaakna anei halli ama'n amasonna asinasik jarra chongpena aleinei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:13">10:1–13:13</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Pathian lungdou dungjuiya Christa Jisu tirton Paul khat-um ni-u ninai Timothy in</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Achaia rampumpuiya kaom Pathian miring rakip ngaile inruoiya Corinthia ah kaom Pathian koisuok ngaidiang: <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Chuon 18:1</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Nipa Pathian khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa riangwai li akadai kha ningchungnga kaom erase.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul in Pathian Minpaakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Nipumi Jisu Christa Pale Pathian um ka-eii, riangwai kajet Pa khat-um angrakip ah sanna kanei Pathian ama kha minpaakrui; <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />eini nipumtak in Pathian diangnga nimu sanna khan, eini innum tu ka-ang kapoong karaal ngai sanna ninei matornasik, ama'n nipoong niraalna rakip khan anasanjei. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ajarchu Christa poongraalna khan keini'n tum katamma kinnei angnga, Christa jarra keini innum kalok-ah Pathian nasanna khan tum kinnei. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Keini'n kapoong karaal kindei inchu, khawa kha nangni sannasik khat-um sanminringnasik eii, halli keini anasan inchu, keini idei ka-ang poongna ngaikha kakhaangle inruoiya ningdei nasik le ranak ngarnasik nangni um anasansik eii. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Khawa jarra nangni chungnga kin-inngamna kha acheet; ajarchu kinpoongna khan tum ningnaneipui angnga, sanna kinmuna suungnga nangni um tum ningnei eii.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ajarchu, ule-nai ngai, Asia ramma kinpoong kinraalna ngai jarra nangni'n ningjetsik hi kinmanuom, tichu, keini matorna chungtiang phurrik kaloktak khat-um karik innaminroonna keini ringkinte ti-um leingaidonmung. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Cor 15:32</ref> </char><verse eid="2CO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Thina sik-ah chonghi kinchungnga omjei tia kinleijet; takkha kinpumtak khan inngai mungnga, akathi kaminring Pathian diangkhan inngaina sik-ah hiwa ngaihi akasuok ejei. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ama'n keini kha hituk chikaom thina khanna inphut anakatanjei halli analakatan sik eii; ama'n eini woikhat-um analakatansik eii tia, keini'n amadiang kin-inngamna kha kinlada; <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />nangni innum keini ningnina khan ningnaheisan, halli miring katamtak ngai'n keini sik-ah innanipina kha masangna kaomsik eii, halli Pathian rawaan kha keinidiang anapesik eii, halli mi katamkhat in keini sik-ah ama minpaakna inrasa ngaikhan inhongkheeksik eii.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Khuolsi sik Imalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Keini in-orna ajar hichu, hiwa eini nuoipilchung ringkhuo-ah incheenna nangnile niomna suungnga hin omchan katuun li malung inthiang tak-ah Pathian nape wairoonna nuoiya omchan hi kinjui, hiwahi miring ngai singna khan eleiya, Pathian riangwai ranak khanna kintho eii tihi akase akatha jetnakhan namincheen eii. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ajarchu kinmajia hi nangni'n ningteel li ningjetnasik bit kha eii. Takkha nangni'n tuuntak lekteii ningnajet kha pui katungnga leijet matorjei ningte tia kei'n kangaidon. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Tichu, Nipumi Jisu Nikhuoni khan nangnihi keini in-orpuisik ning-eii, keini um nangni in-orpuisik kin eii.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Kei'n hiwa rakip hi inthiangnga kajet jarra nangni'n woini rawaan katha muthei nasik-ah, ma-insakhet ah nangnidiang hongnasik kaleingaidon.<verse eid="2CO 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ajarchu Macedonia ramma kasitiang nangnidiang heiluutsik, halli kaheikir tiang um woikhat heiluut ah, Judea ram katung keihi inthaksik kaleingaidon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Chuon 19:21</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Hinthoa ka-insuukna hin kamalung inthiangmak kamalarrabe? kei'n kangaidon phakhan nangnidiang “Oh, Oh” emakli “Ngang, Ngang” tina sik-ah, kei'n taksa ngaidon dungjuiya kangaidon nabe? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Pathian hichu akatuun karil ejarra, ningchungnga kei chong inkhit hi “Oh” halli “Ngang” kiti emak.<verse eid="2CO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ajarchu Silas le Timothy khat-um kei'n nangni karra achong kinriljol Pathian Sapa Jisu Christa kha “Oh” emakli “Ngang” kinti emak; takkha ama chu “Oh” echei; <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Chuon 18:5</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />ajarchu Pathian chong inkhitna rakip kha amasik achu “Oh” ejei. Khawa sikbit ah Pathian niminpaakna khan, Jisu Christa ama jarra “Amen” niti eii. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Pathian amatak in Christa ah nangnile inruoiya eini sariak nakanoot-ah ringkhuo nakaminchun khat-um eini nakathenkhoi Pathian amatak kha eii. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Ama'n eini chungnga amata ejei ti jetnasik adajei, halli ama'n eini sik-ah inei rakip kangaak sik-ah eini malung suungnga Ratha Inthiang kha anapejei.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Kei sakhi ka-eii Pathian kha kakoiya kiril eii. Ama'n kingaidon ajet! Nangni intookmak nasik ah Corinthia tiang simaknasik kangaidon jei. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Nangni ning-inngamna khan kacheet tak-ah ningngir ti keini'n kinjet; angme ning-inngamna chungnga chong rilkinte kinti emak. Khawa neek-ah nangni ningpumtak hoina sik-ah nangnile inruoiya chuon kintho kha eii.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Khawajarra ningmalung kaminpoongsik ah kei'n nangnidiang woikhat hongmak nasik ka-inngaidonjei. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ajarchu kei'n ningmalung kaminpoong inchu, kei'n kiminpoong ama kha eleiya tu-in keihi naminrok niyame? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Khawa jarra kei kanaminrok mi ngai malung minpoong nasik ah kei nangnidiang hong zootmong, khawa jarra khawa chemajia kha kiheimajia eii. Ajarchu kei karokpha, nangni rakip um ningrok eii tia ka-inngamna eii. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ajarchu kheella kapoong karaal khat-um malungkana khan kei'n nangnidiang mitrathi sarra kamajiajei, hiwahi nangni malung minpoongnasik emak, takkha kei'n nangni rakip kha inthiangnga kanaminriang tikha ningjetnasik eii.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikathamak ngai rangaidamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Tuun miring inkhat in tu ka-ang malung iminpoong om inchu, ama'n keidiang khan naminpoong emak, takkha nangni rakip-um lekkhat anaminpoong jei. (Ajarchu hiwahi amadiang phurrik ka-esik manuom mongnga kiril eii.) <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Nangni katam khat in hinthoa rachaaksik hi hiwa miring sik achu rahoi asuok. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Kha e-innum tuunchu, ama kha amalung masokpi inlang, rangaidamru: kha emak inchu, ama malung hoimakna khan amator thengsik eii. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Halli ama kha inthiangtak-ah ningminriangna kha ajetnasik mindikru tia kinaheini eii. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Kei'n kanaminchuna kha apha rakip-ah kajui sik-ah ning-insuuk chakbe, halli ensuina aheiwapha angtuk kacheet-ah ningngir matorme ti jetnasik hiwa chemajia hi kiheimajia eii. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Angme mi ngai'n intho kha nangni'n ning-ngaidam pha, kei-innum inmani kangaidamjei; ajarchu, kei'n kangaidam pha, nangni jarra Christa maikuungnga angrakip kha kangaidamsik ejei. <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />Hiwahi Seitan in anemna kha eini chungnga inphut aleimak nasik eii; ajarchu ama chuonminsuuk kha angme eini'n nijetmak emak.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Troas ah Malung poongna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Kei'n Christa jarra chongkahoi rilnasik bit-ah Troas katungpha, Pumi'n chuonthonasik lam anamalongpi kha kei'n kamujei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Chuon 20:1</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Takkha kei'n ni-u ninai Titus kha kamumak jarra, kamalung aleipoong; halli inmani ka-inthenpuiya, Macedonia tiang kei kasijei.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa jarra Matorna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Takkha Pathian kha minpaak omchak rase! ajarchu Christa raalmatorna karok-ah sina khan raalring angnga Christa le inruoiya inchunna suungnga Pathian in apha rakip-ah anakeiruoi chak. Halli amun rakip-ah sariak rimkahoi angnga phuonnasik Christa jarra minjetnasik Pathian in naneiman eii. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ajarchu ringna kamu ngaile inmang ngai karra einihi sariak rimkahoi Christa in Pathian diang ipeii dooiphur ka-ang ni-eii. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ajarchu inmangnga kaom ngai sikchu, thinasik tur-rim kha eii, takkha ringna kamungai sikchu hongringna sik sariak rimkahoi kha ejei. Hanchu hiwa chuonsik tume rahoikasuok? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Mi katamtak in Pathian chong kha sial louna tiang insi angnga keini kasi emung, takkha Pathian in keini natir jarra, Christa suok angnga malung inthiangtak-ah ama maikuungnga keini kinril eii.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Inzootna Kathar Suok ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Keini'n kinpumtak jarra woikhat in-or kin angbe? nangnidiang um, emakli nangni diangnga inphut e-innum, kinzootjei tina chemajia mi ngai itho angnga, keini um kinlaheichoi sik abe? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Keini malung suungnga inmajiajei, miring rakip in injet halli inteel keini inei chemajia kha nangni ning eii. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Hiwahi Christa apumtak in imajia keini diangnga inphut ijuotir chemajia kha eii. Hiwahi muk ah khat-um lungpeek chungnga inmajia emak, takkha miring malung suungnga akaring Pathian Ratha khan asanna imajia kha eii.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Keini'n Christa jarra Pathian diang inngamna kinnei jarra hiwahi kinril eii. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Hiwa chuon rakip thomatorna keinidiang iteii tisik neimung; takkha keini thomatorna khachu Pathian diangnga inphut akajuo eii.<verse eid="2CO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ama'n keini hi inzootna thar suungnga chuonkathosik rahoi kasuok namin-ejei; hiwahi injia dan khan emak, takkha Ratha khan eii. Ajarchu injia dan khan thina amasuok, takkha Ratha khan ringna apejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Jer 31:31</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Takkha lungpeek chungnga inmajia dan kha ajuopepha Pathian alur-alianna kha alei-inlarjei. Akawar Moses meelsuo kha akachuoisik e-innum awar heiya Israel mi ngai'n inmit ah lei-en matormu. Khawa thina heikachoi dan ranak khan hituktak lurra ajuo inchu, <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Suok 34:29</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Ratha ah chuon katho ngai lurna khale angtuk ah kalok sikme! <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ajarchu inmangna heikachoi omchan khan alurna anei inchu, sanminringna heikachoi chuon khan kheella lur makniya be! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Khawa jarra aleikawarthei lurna kha athengjei, tuunchu alurna kha kheella awarjei nitisik ejei. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ajarchu pha bongkhat sik-bit khan lurna om inchu, apha kasoottak sik achu angtuk tak kheella lurna omsikme!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Hiwa inngamna hi kinnei jarra, keini iteii chileiya kinril eii. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Akachuoiya inmangthei Moses meelsuo kawar kha Israel mi ngai'n inmu maknasik Moses in ameel maiduongpuon inmakhu eii, khawa Moses kapuo kha keini chu emung. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Takkha inthiangnga inmani inmalung kha aleingar; halli awini katung inzootna maruo larik kha inmani'n inteel pha khawa maiduongpuon takkha inmalung inleimakhu, mi inkhat in Christa le inchun pha bitkhan maiduongpuon kha inkhaijei. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Awini katung Moses dan inteelpha, inmani malung kha maiduongpuon inlamakhu.<verse eid="2CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Takkha chong inthiang in Moses jarra iril, “Pumi diang ama'n ahei-inletpha ama maiduongpuon kha inleikhaipi angnga”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">alam 16 hinthoa malet acha: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maiduongpuon kha inkhaipi</char></note> maiduongpuon kha inkhaipisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Suok 34:34</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Tuunchu, hiwa chong suunghin “Pumi hi” Ratha ejei, halli Pumi Ratha omna munkhan ningle-nuomma omnakha ejei. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Eini rakip chu maikhumleiya Pumi lurna kha niminwar kha eii; khawa lurna Pumi ah inphut akajuo Ratha takkhan ama kapuo-ah apha rakip sik-ah nimeel naminthuulpi ejei.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Neipil Beella Ratha Karei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Pathian ama minriangna suungnga hiwa chuon thosik hi keini diang anape jarra, keini'n kinmalung mindongmung. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Keini'n chuonruok le injakpui kaom chuon rakip kindasuojei; halli maleisei emakli insialla Pathian chongkha rilmung. Pathian mitmuwa katuun war kha kin eya, mi rakipdiang kase katha jetna malungkhan injet theinasik kintho kha eii. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ajarchu keini'n chongkahoi kinril hi inthup inchu, inmangnga kaom ngaidiang bit inthup eii. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Khawa jarra inmani'n inngamnamu, Pathian ka-angjek Christa lurna Chong Kahoiya inphut ajuokawar war kha inmani'n inmumak nasik inmani karra kangamnamak ngai malungkha hiwa nuoipilchung pathian in inmit aminziingpi jei. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ajarchu keini kinpumtak kha kin-inrilsuok emak, takkha Pumi Jisu Christa kha eii, halli kinpumtak hi Jisu jar sikbit ah nangnisuok kin-angnga kinril eii.<verse eid="2CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ajarchu, “Aziingna khan war kaminwarsik eii!” leikati Pathian khan Christa meelsuo kawar chungnga khan Pathian lurna jetna warra anakaruoi sik kinmalung suungnga war kha anaminwarpi jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Inphut 1:3</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Takkha hiwa thomatorna ranak hi malarnasik keini kinpum sik-bit emak ah, Pathian ta enasik ah, keini'n neipilla inbool beella hiwa karei hi kinda eii. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Keini hi apha rakip ah innaminpoong, takkha kinmalung hongmak; keini thodan jetmung, takkha kinngamna kha mathaanmung; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />keini inhalpui katamma kinnei, takkha keini sap kaneimak chu emung; halli woikhat in kase ah innawuok, takkha inmangmung. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ama ringkhuo kha kinpumma inmuna sik-ah, akathi Jisu kha inmangsik kinpum suungnga apha rakip ah keini'n kinchoi. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Hiwa inmangsik kinpum hin Jisu ringna kha kinmalar theinasik, Jisu jarra kinringkhuo thinasik chikaom ngaikhan kin-omchak kha eii. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Hiwa tinachu keini chungnga thina khan chuon atho, halli nangni chungnga chu ringna khan chuon atho tina eii.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />“Kei'n kangamna, khawa jarra kei'n karil.” Chong inthiang in iti, khale in-angrip ngamna ratha khan keini innum kinril eii ajarchu keini'n kin-inngamna. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Minpkla 116:10</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ajarchu Pumi Jisu kaminring ama khan keini rakip um Jisu le inruoiya anaminringsik eii, halli nangnile inruoiya keini um amaikuungnga anaruoisik eii ti kha keini'n kinjet. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Hiwa rakip hi nangni sik-ah eii; halli Pathian riangwai hi mi katamtak chungnga atung jarra, Pathian lurna kha, inmani'n rokpuina nina kha kakheella inpenasik eii.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngamna khan Karing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Hiwa jarsik bit-ah keini'n kinmalung minsiinmung; takkha keini kinpum kintaksa kha ajuo inwuoi innum, keini ratha mi khachu nisuo rakip ah hongthar dadet. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ajarchu hiwa lekteii phabongkhat sikbit ah poongna nidei hin eini sik-ah, poongna neek-ah ngaksik kaom khat-um hektik kaboi lurna kha aheichoisik eii. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ajarchu keini'n nimuthei phur kha emak ah, inmumak phurkhan kinmalung kinpe eii. Mit-ah muthei khachu pha bongkhat sik eii; takkha mit-ah nimutheimak khachu kumsoot sik-ah eii.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ajarchu hiwa neipilchungnga kin-omna riakbuk kintaksa hi achetjei inchu, apha rakip ah omnasik inn inkhat marwaan chungnga Pathian in keinisik naboolpiya om tikha keini'n kinjet. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Tuun marwaan chungnga inphut kajuo keini omnasik innkha puon angnga silnasik keini'n kinngaidonna kalok khan kin-enna kin-om. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Ajarchu, khawa kha keini'n puon angnga kinchoijei inchu keini taksa karuok-ah omnunung jei. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ajarchu hiwa neipilchung riakbuk hin kin-omlai, keini'n malung kahoimak le inruoiya kin-inkoiya kin-om; halli hiwa nuoipilchung taksa hi pesik kinmanuom chu emak; takkha marwaan ta kha eini'n ni-inlukli inmangsik ka-ekha akaring khan inthuulnasik, keini'n puon angnga silsik kinmanuom eii. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Hiwa inthuulnasik bit-ah eini kha kanabool, khat-um eini sik-ah achong-inkhitna kangaak sik-ah ama Ratha eini diangnga kanape kha Pathian eii.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Khawa jarra keini'n apha rakip ah kinratha arok, halli taksa inna niom laiseng eini'n Pumi inna inphut kalaak ah nilaom ti kinjet. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Ajarchu eini ringkhuo chu ngamna jarra eii, mit-ah nimu jarra emak. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Keini'n hiwa taksa innhi mathaanna Pumi le omsuom nasik innkha keini'n kinmanuom khetkha eii; khawasik khan keini kinratha karok eii. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Eini innhin e-innum emakli soson e-innum hon e-innum, angrakip neek-ah keini'n ama malung mintaisik hi kinmanuom.<verse eid="2CO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ajarchu eini taksa ringkhuo suungnga eini rakip in nileitho rakip dungjuiya, akatha e-innum, kathamak e-innum, eini rakip in nimusik rahoikasuok kha nimunasik, eini niraja-ah ama'n chong tannasik Christa maikuungnga nila-inlar wiaksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Rom 14:10</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa jarra Pathian le Sap khat ena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Khawa jarra Pumi kha chiru tina kha kinjet ah, keini'n mileiilak ngaikha kinmatheem eii; Pathian in keini inthiangnga najet, khawa angnga ningmalung suungnga kei um najet ningte tia ka-inngaidon. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Keini'n kintheinuo ah nangnidiang kin-inriltha nook emak, khawa neek ah keini jarra ning in-or nasik tuka-ang mi ngai omchan jarra ka-emak meelsuo ah in-or ngaidiang ningmasang theinasik nangnidiang keini'n ajar katha kha napesik kintho eii. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Keini inthiangnga inweet kin-ebe? Inweet kin-e inchu hiwa hi Pathian sik eii; Emakli keini inweetmak kin-ebe? Inweetmak kin-e inchu hiwa hi nangni sik-ah eii. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ajarchu Christa minriangna khan kinchungnga wairoon jarra mi rakip sik-ah mi inkhat in ithi kha keini'n kinjet, khawa tinachu ama thina khan inmani rakip in tum inchang hetjei. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Ama'n mi rakip sik-ah aleithi jarra karingnga kaom ngaikhan woikhat intheinuo sik-ah karing emujei, takkha inmanisik jarra thiya ahongkaring ama sik-bit khan akaringsik in-eii.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Khawa jarra tuunchu keini'n tuteii miring taksa tiang akaring kapuo ah ngaidonmung jei. Apha inkhat-ah Christa kha-um taksa miring angnga karing eii tia kinleingaidon, takkha tuunchu keini'n ngaidon khaimungjei. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Khawa jarra tu e-innum Christa le inchun mi khachu akathar miring inkhat ejei, akamaruo kha athengjei, enru, akathar kha aheitungjei. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Hiwa rakip hi Pathian itho eii, Ama'n keini hi Christa jarra ama inhalpui kinlei eya inphut ama sap namin-ejei halli keini diang-um mi leiilak ngaikha ama sap kamin esik ah chuon kha anapejei. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Keini chongroon khachu, Christa jarra Pathian in miring rakip asap min-enasik iboolhi eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:19. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Christa jarra Pathian in miring rakip asap min-enasik ibool </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli Pathian in Christa diang omma miring rakip hi asap min-enasik ibool</char></note> Inmani manu kha Pathian in teelpi makjei, halli angtho thoa ama'n inmani kha sap ah iboolme ti chongkha ama'n keinidiang anapejei.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Khawa jarra, Pathian ama tak-in keini diangnga iril angnga, Keini Christa sik chongkaril ngaikha kin-eii, Khawa jarra Christa rathuulla nangnidiang kinnati eii, Pathian in nangni kha na-inhalpuiya inphut asap namin erase. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Christa kha manu neimak eii, takkha eini ama le ni-inchunna suungnga Pathian dikna kha nichang suomnasik, Pathian in eini manu kha ama tum namin epijei.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Pathian le inruoiya keini chuonthona khan, tuunchu, nangni'n Pathian riangwai kha ningmujei, khawa kha anemna kaboi min-emaru tia keini'n kinnati eii. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Pathian iril kha angme rangairu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Kei'n nangsik zootpinakha malarnasik pha aheitung pha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Kei'n nanina kha kanajetpi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Sanminringna sik nikhuo aheitung pha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">kei'n nang kha kanasanjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa 49:8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Rangairu! Hiwa phadan hi Pathian nazootpina munasik pha kha eii; awini hi sanminringna nikhuo kha eii!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Keini chuonthona suungnga tu ka-ang inkhat in insial inmusik hi manuom mung, khawa jarra alam rakip ah tu ka-ang inkhat minsui maknasik kintho eii. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Angrakip rathuulla deiraatna, poongna khat-um intak rakip chungnga Pathian suok kinchangna kha kinmalarra eii.<verse eid="2CO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Keini innaleiwuok, mikhumna ah inlet-inlet ah innada, chongsuok lasuokna khan baklei emakli zaalleiya chuon keini'n kintho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Chuon 16:23</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Pathian suok kin-ena hi, kin-inthiangna, kinjetna, kindeiraatna kha riangwai khan kinmalar. Ratha Inthiang khan, minriang katuun, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />kinchong katuun, khat-um Pathian ranak khan kinmalar eii. Keini'n akatuun kha kinraalphur angnga raalthona le raaldeina kha kinmin eii. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Keini kayana innanei khat-um kaya makna innanei; keini innaminjak halli innaminpaak. Keini maleisei karil angnga innalei, kha-ennum keini akatuun kha kinril; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />injetmak angnga innatho, kha-ennum mirakip in innajet; akathi kin-ang, takkha enru, keini kinlaring, innarachaak takkha keini nathatmu; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />kinmalung apoong innum apha rakip ah kinrok; keini sara kin-eii takkha miring angjet kinminchong; keini iteii kaneimak kin eii, kha e-innum keini inthiangnga angrakip kha kinneiwiak.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />E, Corinthia ah kaom kinsap ngai! Keini'n inthiangtak ah nangnidiang kinril eii; keini malung kalok ah kinnamalongpi. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Keini'n kinmalungkot nakharpimung; nangni inchu ningmalungkot keinisik ningnakharpi. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Kasa ngai angnga tuun nangnidiang kiril eii; keini'n nangnisik kinngaidonna kha nangni innum in-angrip ah keinidiang naminmuru! Ningmalungkot kalok ah malongru!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nangni Akaring Pathian Biak-inn ning eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Akangamnamak ngai khale in-angrip ah chuon thosuom maru, ajarchu khawa kha etheinuni. Angtho thoa akatuun li akatuunmak khan ininchunthei sikme? Halli angtho-thoa akawar li akaziing khan in-omsuomthei sikme? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Angtho-thoa Christa le Seitan kha ininzootthei sikme? Halli akangamnapa khan angme akangamnamakpa le tum inneisuom theisik?<verse eid="2CO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Halli Pathian biak-inn le zaatlop kutbool pathian ngaile ang inzootna ommame? Ajarchu einichu akaring Pathian biak-inn kha ni-eii! Pathian apumtak khan ileiti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Kei'n ka-inn kami ngaile kaboolsik eii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">halli inmani karra kaomsik eii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Kei'n inmani Pathian ka-esik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">halli inmani'n kei kami in-esik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Cor 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">6:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:12">Levi 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 37:27">Suok 37:27</ref> </char><verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Khawa sik-bit khan Pumi'n ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Nangni'n inmani ningmasuosik eii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">halli inmani diangnga inphut nangni inteiru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">khat-um inthiangmak katook maru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">halli kei'n nangni kha kanakeiluut sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa 52:11</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Kei'n ningpa ka-esik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">halli nangni'n kasanu, kasapa ngai ning-esik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Kamator khet Pumi khan ati.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Khang 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa 43:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Jer 31:9</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Minriang kaom kasap ngai, hiwa ngai senghi eini diangnga achong-inkhitna kha eii, khawa jarra Pathian kachi tak-ah karing, puikatung tak-ah inthiangnasik thorui; taksa le ratha inthiang makna-ah inphut nitheinuo ah inthiang rui.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Rokna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Keinisik bit-ah ningmalung suungkhan amun naperu. Keini'n miring tuteii diang akadikmak thomung, keini'n miring tuteii khat kha-um minmang mung, keini'n miring tuteii inkhat diang-um nemnasik ratokmung. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Kei'n nangni minsialnasik hi kinril emak; ajarchu thina-ah thisuomsik emakli ringna-ah ringsuomnasik apha rakip ah keini sik-ah khatuk minriang kaom ning-eii tia matiang khan kariljei. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Kei'n hituk nangni kha kana-inngamna; ningchungnga in-orna alok! Kinpoongna rakip-ah tuunkatung kana inngamna alasip jarra; Kei karok in anasipjei.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Keini'n Macedonia kinheitungsuo katung, keini soongmachumna leineimung, takkha aleiilak le insuolna, amun rakip-ah poongraalna kha aomma, kinmalung suungnga akachi kha aleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CO 2:13">2 Cor 2:13</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Takkha malung kapoong kamasok Pathian khan Titus heiwale inruoiya kinmalung anamasokpi. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Halli eini nakaminrok Titus iheiwa jar bitkhan emak, takkha achong heiroon jarra um eii, khachu nangni'n amalung ningheimasokpi, kei angtuktak ningnamuzoot, angtuk ningmalung kahoimak, kei sanringnasik ning-insuuk kha anarilpi jei, khawa jarra kei'n kheella tuun karokjei.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ajarchu kachemajia khan ningmalung aleiminpoong jei innum, kei'n khawa kimajia khan insirmong. Ajarchu khawa chemajia khan phabong khat ningmalung aleiminpoong kha kamu phakhan kei ka-insirsik eii. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Takkha tuunhin ningmalung kaminpoong jarra kei kirok emak, takkha ningmalung poongna jarkhan ning-omchan aminthuul thei jarra kei karok. Khawa malung minpoongna kha keini naminmangna kha emak, Pathian in ineiman eii. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ajarchu Pathian lungdou dungjuiya malung kapoong khan, sanminringna tiang lamkakei, malung thuulnasik akaheiruoi ejarra khawa khan malung insirnasik ommak, takkha nuoipilchung malungpoongna khanchu thina amasuok. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Ajarchu enru, hiwa ningmalung poongna hin, Pathian in angme itho: nangni iteii kajetmak ning enasik-ah, angtuk malung kaluut-ah inaboolme! khawatuk lunghongna, khawatuk china, khawa ngai jetna, khawatuk malungluutna, chuonkathamak katho ngai rachaakna sik-ah in-insuukna! Khawa rakip chungnga nangni ningtheinuo-ah iteii masialna kaneimak ah ning inlar.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Khawa jarra kei'n nangnidiang kamajia jei innum, chuon kathosial inkhat chungnga emakli kamasialpa jarra kiheimajia emak. Khawa rathuulla, angtuk keini chungnga ningmalung aluutme tihi Pathian mitmuwa inthiangnga nangnidiang inlarnasik kei'n kimajia eii. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Khawa jarra keini kinratha arok.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Keinibit kinratha karok emak-ah; nangni'n Titus kha alam rakip-ah ningraya-ah ningheisanna amalung ningminhoipina ama rokna khan kinmalung aminrokdet. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Kei'n nangni jarra amadiang kalei in-or, nangni'n kei malung kahoimak naminthomak chu. Takkha keini'n nangnidiang apha rakip akatuun kha kinril, halli kha-angnga Titus diangnga keini in-orna kha akatuun eii tikha inthiangjei. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Halli nangni rakip in kachi khat-um intuulle inruoiya ama kha ningleidon halli achong juinasik ningtho kha angaidon pha, ama naminriangna kha ahongkheeljei. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Kei'n nangni chungnga pui katungnga ka-inngamna mator jarra, angtuktak kirokme!<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Christian Phurpeii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Ulenai ngai, Macedonia koisuok ngaidiang Pathian riangwai'n ileitho chuonkha nangni'n ningjetsik kinmanuom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Rom 15:26</ref> </char><verse eid="2CO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Inmani poongraalna khan kanatak-ah enminsuinna inlei-intongpui innum, karok khan aleisip jarra inmani kha sarathei inlei e-innum malung inthiangnga pena inleinei. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ajarchu inmani'n inmatorseng inpekha kei'n kirilcheenpi eii, halli inpematorna chungtiang kheella inmani'n pezoottak ah inpejei. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Inmani'n Judea ramma kaom Pathian mi ngai sanna khan tum neikinte tia keinidiang innaheiniya eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Hiwa inthohi eini ngaidonna chungtiang khan ejei, inmani'n mansakhet-ah Pumi diang ininpesuok khawa suo-ah Pathian lungdou in-entok ah, keinidiang um inlei inpesuok. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Khawa jarra hiwa minriang chuon kapoi hi ama'n aleiphut suojei, hiwa chuonhin pui-katungnga nangni anasanna achuontho kha minjomnasik keini'n Titus kha kinmasok eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Angrakip ah nangni ning-inchong theijei: inngamna ah, chongrilla, jetna-ah, ningsanzootna-ah halli keini ningnaminriangna khan nangni ning-inchong jei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:7. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">keini ningnaminriangna; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscripts lekkhat ah, nangni kinnaminriangna</char></note> Khawa jarra hiwa minriang chuon hinnum malungkalok ning esik kinmanuom.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Kei'n sinadan ngaikha kinape emak, takkha aleiilak ngai'n angtuk insanzootme ti naminmunasik, nangni minriangna kha angtuk inthiangme ti kajetzoot-ah eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ajarchu eini Pumi Jisu Christa riangwaikha nangni'n ningjet, ama sara ejarra nangni inchong inkhat enasik, ama'n hituk inchong alei e-innum, nangnisik jarra sara ajuo ejei.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Hiwa jarra kei i-ngaidon khachu hi eii; akatheng kumma ningleiphutjei chuonkha tuunchu ningthosuo sik hi nangnisik akatha eii. Chuontho sikbit eleiya thozoottak-ah katho hi-um, nangni ma-insakhet ka-esik ning eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Thozoot tak-ah ningleiminsuuk kha angnga, thosik-ah ningnei sengkha tuun chuon kha minhektru. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Angjarrame nitinchu, Nangni'n pezoottak ah kape ning-e-inchu, Pathian in nangni kutchoi kha ningnei dungjuiya aralaangsik eii, ningneimak khan e-nuni.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Mileiilak ngai zaangnasik nangni phurrik naminroon sik katina emak, takkha tuun nangni'n katamma ningneilai hin, akaneimak ngaikha ningleisansik hi akatha eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Nangni'n ninghong neimakpha, inmani'n katamma inhong neiya e-inchu, inmani'n nangni innasannook sik eii, khan ningthoa inkhat li inkhat in-ang rip-ah ning insansik eii.<verse eid="2CO 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Chong inthiang khan ati, “Katamma kabuk ama kha-um katamma neidoommak, katoom kabuk ama kha-um iteii insam lei-ommak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Suok 16:18</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Titus le Ama Sappui ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Titus malung suungnga keinile in-angnga nangni sanzootna kanapeii Pathian kha angtuk kirokpui me. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ajarchu ama'n keini chongril inazootpi khabit emak-ah, atheinuo ah anasanzoot heiya nangni diang iheiwa eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Halli amale inruoiya chongkahoi rilna chuon jarra koisuok rakip in inkayathei ulenai ngaikha keini'n kinheitir eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Halli khawa bit-um emak, takkha Pumi lurnasik khat-um keini mi sanzootna kinneihi malarna sik-ah ama hi koisuok ngai'n keinile inruoiya hiwa minriang chuonna kasisuom sik-ah inkadang eii.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Hiwa insanna malungkalok kutchoi pejar hin, tuteii inkhat in noonkuung iteii innapemak nasik keini kin-inchiksa theiya kinom.<verse eid="2CO 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Hiwahi Pumi mitmu sikbit emak-ah, miring mit-enna um akadik thosik hi kinmanuom eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Chongngil 3:4</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Khawasik bit-ah nisappui amahi, inmanile inruoiya kinheitir eii; keini'n ama hi apha kasoottak ensuina kinneiya, sannasik hin amalung aluut tikha kinmu, halli tuun nangnidiang ama inngamna hi kheella omjarra nakasan sik-ah kheella aratha aleirokjei. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Titus hichu nangni kanasansik keile chuon kathosuom kasap eii; hanna nisappui lekkhat amale kahong ngai khachu, Christa lurna karoon koisuok rakip ngai rathuulla akajuo in-eii. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nangni jarra keini in-orna kha adik tia inthiangnga koisuok rakip ngai'n injetnasik, inmani diang ningminriangna kha leimalarru.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Akangamna Sara ngai Sanna sik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Judea ramma kaom Pathian mi ngai sansik jarra tirsik hin kei'n heimajiasik hi inthiangnga iteii arei ommakjei. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ajarchu ningsanzootna kha kei'n kajet, halli Macedonia mi ngaidiang nangni jarra in-orna kaleinei, “Achaia ramma akangamna ngaidiang,” kei'n kaleiril “Akatheng kum makheiya inphut nasannasik in-insuukjei.” Khawa nangni ratharokna khan inmani katamtak masokna aleinei. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Nangni jarra kinlei in-orna kha anemna kaboi chong enuni ti kangaidonna, tuun kei'n akangamna ngaikha kaheitir, khachu kileiril kha angnga ningsan nasik khale inruoiya lei-insuukna sik eii. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Kha emak inchu, Macedonia mi ngaikhan keile inruoiya kahong pha, ninglei-insuuk mak kha inmu inchu, nangni injak bit rilsik e-nuniya hituktak nangni jarra ngamna hin ni-injakthei sik ejei. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Khawa jarra kutchoi pena sik-ah chong ninglei inkhit kha kahongmakma ningleida nasik, nangni insok sik-ah hiwa akangamna ngaihi mansa-ah nangnidiang inhongsik hi arei omjei tia kangaidonjei. Halli kei kahongpha, nangni'n manarleiya pezoottak-ah ningpekha inmunasik lei-insuuk taru.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Muchi lekteii kaworpa khan lekteii aluok sik eii; muchi katamtak kaworpa khan katamma aluok sik eii, tihi ngaidonru. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Nangni rakip in pesik tia ningleingaidon kha angnga peru, kamanar emakli thomakchamak omchanna kape emaru; ajarchu karok karok ah kape mi kha Pathian in aminriang. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Halli athana lam rakip ah kakheella napemator nasik le apha rakip ah nangni sik-ah arei rakip chungtiang, insam kaboiya nangni sik-ah Pathian in nangnidiang anapemator.<verse eid="2CO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Chong-inthiang khan hin ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Ama'n malung kalok ah sara ngaidiang apeii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">Aminriangna hektik neileiya aomchak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Minpkla 112:9</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Halli muchi kaworpa diangkhan muchi khat-um bak sik-ah bakphur kanape ama'n nangni sik-ah arei ka-e muchi rakip napete, halli naminmoongpita nangni malung kalok-ah ningpena kara kha anaminluok sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">Isa 55:10</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Ama'n nangni apha rakip ah malungkalok enasik anaminchongsik eii, halli mi rakip in ningkutchoipe kha keini diangnga inphut inmu khan Pathian inminpaak sik eii. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Hiwa insanna chuon ningthohi Pathian mi ngai insamna khanbit ningsan emak-ah, Pathian minpaak nale roknakha ajuoluongnasik um ejei. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Hanna hiwa chuon ningtho hin, ningamna inthiang kha ningmalar eii; ajarchu nangni'n Christa chongkahoihi kinngamna tia ningrilsuok khabit eleiya, chuon tak-ah malung kalok-ah ningnei rakip khan inmanile mirakip diang ning-insempui jarra inmani'n Pathian kha inminpaaksik eii. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Hanna nangni chungnga inteidoomma Pathian riangwai anape jarra inmani'n nangni riangwai inmunasik Pathian diang riangwai kaloktak nangnisik innanipisik eii. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Akutchoipe aman kaboi jarhin eini'n Pathian kha minpaakrui.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Paul Achuon Chungnga Inngaakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Paul, kei tak-in nangnile niomsuom lai kamalung adai khat-um kanunchan inchuol, takkha niomsuom mak pha nangnidiang kachi omleiya karil. Khawa jarra kei'n Christa malung kadai khat-um nunchan inchuol khan nangnidiang chana kaheinei. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Kei'n kaheiwa phakhan kase-ah thomak chamak keidiang natimaru tia kei'n nangnidiang chana kanaheinei, ajarchu eini nuoipilchung taksa sik-ah chuon katho ning-eii kanati ngaidiang khan kei'n kase-ah katho matorsik eii. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Eini'n nuoipilchung taksa-ah nilaring tichu adik, takkha keini'n nuoipilchung taksa sik-ah raal kinthochu emak, <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />ajarchu keini raalthona raalphouchu nuoipilchung raalphou emak, takkha akangar raalmun kamakoi mator Pathian ranak ngarna raalphou kha kinneimanna raal kintho. Akadikmak murruolsiak kha kinmakoi; <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Pathian jetna inhalpuiya lamkakharra in-or rakip ngaikha keini'n kinmakoijei, malungroon rakip kinsurra halli Christa chong kha kinminjui. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Nangni'n pui katungnga chong ningjui incheen suopha, chongkajuimak rakip ngaikha rachaaknasik keini'n kin-insuuk sik eii.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Nangni'n phur rakip hi atuoltiang bit ning-en. Mi lekkhat in, inmani Christa mi ka-eii kati in-ombe? inmani Christa mi in-e angnga keini um Christa mi kin-ejarra inmani'n inmani jarra ngaidonnook rasu. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ajarchu Pathian in keinidiang inape thomatorna jarra kei'n katamma ka-in-or innum kei injakmong; hiwa thomatorna hichu nangni mangnasik emak-ah, nangni kanaboolna kha eii. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Kache heimajia hin kei'n nangni kanamathina ka-esik hi kei'n manuommong. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ajarchu mi lekkhat in inti, “Paul chemajia ngaihi intak khat-um angar, takkha amitak nikoolla ompha amalung adai, halli achongril um iteii emak intisik eii!” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Khawa ka-ang mi inkhat khan, keini kinom makpha halli nangni le kin-ompha keini larik-ah kinmajia ngai khali kinthosik kha iteii inthenna ommak tihi jetrase.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ajarchu inpumtak ka-inpaak tu ka-ang ngaikhale inruoiya keini'n kinpum tak hi inteel delsik, emakli inkhi puisik keini emung; inmani khat li khat inmani omchan khan chong-intan, halli inmani khat li khat inkhina innei, inmani kha angtuk-ah akamo in-eme! <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Keinisik achu, Pathian in keini sik-ah nadapi chuon halli nangni karra chuon katha kintho hiwa katung bit-hi keini in-orna eii, hiwa eleiya kakheella keini in-ornasik ommak. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Nangni'n khawa suungnga ning-om jarra, keini'n nangnidiang Christa jarra chongkahoi kinheichoiya kiheiwapha hiwa ngaihi keini'n rakaanna simung. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Khawa jarra Pathian in keini sik-ah inadapi kha kakheella mileiilak ngai chuonleithona chungnga keini in-orpui mung. Khawa rathuulla Pathian napena suungnga apha rakip ah nangni karra chuon kalokdet thona sik-ah ning-inngamna kha insoonna sik hi kinngaidon eii. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Hiwasuo hinchu nangni kinnarakaan li ramleiilak ngai tiangson Pathian Chongkahoi kha kinjuoril thei, takkha mileiilak ngai chuonleithona chungnga keini in-orna sik iteii ommak.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Takkha Pathian chong inthiang iril angnga, “Tu e-innum in-orzoot mi inom inchu, Pumi chuonthonasa jarkhan in-orpui rase.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9:24</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ajarchu atheinuo-ah inriltha mi kha emak Pathian in izoot, takkha Pumi'n iriltha mi kha eii Pathian in izoot.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Paul khat-um Akatuunmak Tirton ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Kei'n lekkhat kaleimona phakha alei-om innum nangni'n ningna rangaitheipisik hi kei'n kamanuom. Nazootpi inlang nathopiru! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Pathian in nangni nara-ot angnga kei'n nangni kha kanara-ot; ajarchu inthiang nungaak angnga nangnihi inkhatbit ka-eii miring Christa diang moiruoinasik ah chong inkhitna kanei jei.<verse eid="2CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Eve kha malung kathamak amaleikasei maruul khan maleisei itho angnga, nangni'n Christa diangnga malungningpe inthiang li kasip kha ningda-ah malung kathamaktiang situn tia kanachipui. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-5">Inphut 3:1-5</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:13">13</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ajarchu nangni'n keini diangnga inphut ningleikeiluut jei Ratha khat-um Chongkahoi khanna inphut inteidomma keini'n kinleirilmak inkhat, intei Jisu chong karil mi ngaikha inhong pha karok ah nangni'n inmani kha ningleidon!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Kei chu nangni “Tirton” kapoi khet eii tia ningkoingai neek-ah kei kasiinkhet inkhat ka-eii tia inngaidon mong. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Kei'n chongrilna tiang akajetmak ka-eii innum, kajet makchu emong; takkha apha rakip-ah omchan rakip kha keini'n nangnidiang kinleirilsuo ejei.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Kei'n nangni hi akalur namin enasik kei katheinuo-ah kanunchan ka-inchuolla; nangnidiang Pathian Chongkahoi karillai khan aman naleinimong. Khawa khan kei kithosial ombe? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Kei'n nangni karra chuon katholai khan koisuok lekkhat in kachuon thoman kha innape eii. Nangni sanna sik-ah inmani ngai sial-sum kha kei'n kakasutjei tithei eii.<verse eid="2CO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Kei'n nangnile niomsuom phakhan sial-sum ka-insampha, kei'n nangni nasanru tia nangni ninglu naleiminsapi mong; ajarchu Macedonia ah inphut akaheiwa akangamna ulenai ngaikhan ka-insamna rakip khan kei sik-ah innaheichoipi. Apha akathengsa angnga, nuktiang um nangnidiang kei phurrik inchangnuning. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Phil 4:15-18</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Christa dikna kha keidiang omjarra Achaia rampumpuiya ka-in-orna hi naminda matornunu tia kei'n chong-inkhitna kanei. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Kei'n nangni kanaminriangmak jarra hi kirilbe? Kinaminriang kha Pathian in ajet.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />“Tirton” leiilak ngai'n, keini itho le in-ang rip-ah kintho eii tia in-orpuiya chong inril hi kaminthomak nasik bit-ah, tuunna kitho hi khan kalathosik eii. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Khawa mi ngaikha tirton katuun ngaikha emu. Inmani ngaikha Christa tirton inthiang ngai angnga ininleemma inchuon jarra maleisei katho tirton katuunmak ngaikha in-eii. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Athajei, hiwahi ngaksik ommak! ajarchu Seitan innum apumtak kha marwaan tirton kawar kapuo-ah munasik inleem theiya eii! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Khawa jarra seitan suok ngaikhan suok katuuntak angnga munasik ininleem sikkha chuon kaloktak emak; ajuohekna nikhuo khan inmani'n intho dungjuiya inmusik rahoi kasuok kha inmusik eii.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul Tirton inkhat eya Apoongna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Kei'n woikhat inlet ah karil, tu-inkhat innum kei hi kamo eii ti-inlang nangaidon marasu; nangni'n kei kamo ningnamin e-innum, lekkhat ka-in-or theinasik kamo angnga nangaidon taru. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Tuunna kei'n kiril hi Pumi naminril emak, takkha hiwa ngamna in-orna jarra inthiangnga chong kirilhi, kamo inkhat ki-e angnga kiril eii. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ajarchu katamtak in nuoipilchung taksa dungjuiya inin-or jarra, kei um inmanile in-angnga ka-in-or sik eii. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Nangni ningtheinuo-ah khatuk ningsing, halli khawa jarra kamo ngaikha karok ah ningleidonthei. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Tu e-innum ningchungnga wai aroonna, anabak minram innum, kase-ah innatho innum, innasur innum, namai akabeen innum karoktak ah ningleidon theisik ejei. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Khawa ngai kathosik keinichu kinchiraat tisik hi keichu ka-injak!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Takkha mi inkhat ngai'n angkeme khat jarra in-or ngam inchu, kamo ka-angnga kachongril dungjuiya hin kei-um kha angnga ka-in-or ngam. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Inmani Hebrew ngai in-ebe? kei-um ka-eii. Inmani Israel ngai in-ebe? kei um ka-eii. Inmani Abraham sangai in-ebe? kei um ka-eii.<verse eid="2CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Inmani Christa suok ngaikha in-ebe? kei inweet mi inkhat angnga rilkate, inmani neek-ah akatha suok inkhat ka-eii. Chuon kakheella katho, mikhumna khan kakheella kaom, innawuok um teelmaneii sik ommak, thisik kathona um atam. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Chuon 16:23</ref> </char><verse eid="2CO 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Jihudi ngai'n ramolla woisoomthum leikuo hi woira-nga chak innaleiwuok. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Innidan 25:3</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Woithum Roman ngai'n innawuok jei, lungnga woikhat innadeeng jei, woithumchak rakuong koina khan kalei-inchel, phadan soomnileimili tuiya woikhat kalei-omjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Chuon 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:19">Chuon 14:19</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Kei'n khuol-injil kasina rakip ah tuikalian in, inruup ngai'n, kami ngaidiang halli zaatlop ngaidiang, khuopuiya, ramruok ah, tuipuiya, akatuunmak ulenai ngai diangnga inphut poongna katamtak kalei intongpui. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Chuon 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:5">14:5</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Kachuon thona khan; zaalleiya; wonchaam tuiraal kaleidei, bak khopleiya, omna omleiya, puondiar hunleiya kaleiom. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Aleiilak rilleiya, nisuo-ah koisuok ngaisik bit kamalung kadong khan kachungnga anadel. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Tu ka-ang inkhat suol pha kei-um kasuol; tu ka-ang khat manuwa atapha, kamalungnga poongna khan asip.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Kei ka-in-or inchu, kachuon thona jarra hin angtukme kisuol ti malarna ah ka-in-or sik eii. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Pumi Jisu Pa khat-um Pathian raming kha hektik omleiya rokpuichak kha erase! kei maleisei rilmong tihi ama'n ajet.<verse eid="2CO 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Kei Damascus ah kaomlai, Arestas Reng nuoiya waikaroonpa in kei nakasur sik khuopui kotkhan raalpa aleimintho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Chuon 9:23-25</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Takkha keichu rapal inweng khan kok inkhat-ah innamachumma, ama diangnga inphut kaleisuokjei.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Chongmalar khat-um Paul Mangtalar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Anemna ommak innum, kei ka-in-or sik eii. Tichu Pumi'n keidiang mangtalar le chongmalar ngai inape jarkha tuun ril kate. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Kum soomleimili matiang Christian mi inkhat insaangkhet marwaan khan iruoi kha kei'n kajet (Khawakha inthiangnga kasuoktakbe, emakli ama'n mangtalar imube kei'n jetmong; Pathian in bitchu ajet). <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Kei'n kirilnook eii, hiwa mi hi Paradise ah iruoi kei'n kajet (woikhat um khawakha inthiangtakbe emakli, hiwahi mangtalar be kei jetmong. Pathian in bitchu ajet.) <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Halli khawa paradise khan ama'n miring murra inriltheimakle chongnga um riltheilei chong katamtak aleijet. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Hiwa mipa jarra kei in-or kate; takkha kei angtukme kisuol ti kamalar ngaikha eleiya kei jarra katheinuo-ah in-or nuning. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Kei in-or zoot ka-e inchu, kamo inkhat ka-emak nasik, akatuuntak kha kei rilkate, takkha anakamu li anakajet mi inkhat in kakheeldoomma kei jarra innangaidonmak nasik, kei in-or nuning.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Takkha kei'n inlak-inlak katamtak kamu jarra kheella ka-in-or maknasik-ah, khawakhan Seitan chuonkatho tirton inkhat angnga kei kanawuok sik halli ka-in-or mak nasik ah, taksa ah raling isun kana inkhat keidiang anapejei. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Khawakha kei diangnga inphut nakeisuopi nasik woithum kei'n Pumi diang hiwa jarra kaleinijei. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Takkha ama'n anamasang, “Kei kariangwai hi nang sik-ah ahunjei, ajarchu nang nasuolpha, kei karanak hi angar.” Khawa phakhan Christa nasanna ranak kha kachungnga omnasik, kakheella kei'n kasuolna ngaikhan karok ah ka-in-or pui. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Christa sik jarra kasuolna rakip, injakna rakip, poongna rakip, kase-ah innathona rakip halli intakna rakip kadeiya kamalung kamintai. Ajarchu kei kasuol phakhan karanak angar.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul in Corinthia ngaisik Ingaidon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Kei kamo inkhat angnga chuon kathojei. Takkha hiwahi nangni'n kei ningnamintho eii; nangni'n kei ningnajet cheenna kha ningmalarsik kasuok eii. Ajarchu kei iteii ka-emak innum, keichu nangni “Tirton” kapoi ngai karra akasiinkhet khachu emong. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Kei tirton inkhat kachangna jetcheenna khachu, nangni karra poongna rakiple inruoiya ngak kaom chuon inlak angjet kileitho ngaihi eii. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Sialsum ningnasanna sik kinani eleiya kei'n nangni naminpoong mong, koisuok leiilak ngai neek-ah angtuk kasedet ah kanathona om mabe? Hiwa kamasialna ngaihi narangaidamru.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Tuun nangnidiang hongnasik ah ki-insuuk hi woithum huuina ejei, hanna kei'n nangnidiang iteii nani nuning; kei imanuom khachu nangnisial emak; nangni kinamanuom keeng. Ajarchu insangai khan innu inpa sik iteii buk ngaimu, takkha innu inpa ngai'n insangai sik kha inbuksik eii. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Kei'n nangni nasan nasik kapumtak le kinei rakip kaneiman wiaksik hi kei roknasik kha eii. Kei'n hituk hin kanaminriang jarra, nangni'n kei lekteii bit ningnaminriang sikbe?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Tuunhin kei nangni sik-ah phurrik inkhat ki-emak hi ningzootjei. Takkha mi inkhat in kei'n malung kathamak le maleisei thoa nangni nasurnasik itho eii tithei eii. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Angtho thoa? Kei'n nangnidiang kiheitir chongkaroon ngai jarra nangni diangnga kei'n anemna kaleiyabe? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Kei'n Titus nangnidiang ahong nasik kaleiti, halli amale inruoiya akangamna leiilak um kaheitir. Titus in nangni diangnga inphut anemna aleitheisik eii ningtibe? Ama le kei in-angrip malung kinroonna, omchan in-ang chuon kinthosuom emak abe?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Apha rakip ah nangni maikuungnga inngaak nasik kinratok ah chong kinrilchak eii tia nangni'n nangaidonthei eii. Khawakha emak! Pathian maikuungnga Christa naminrilzoot kha keini'n kinrilla, kintho rakip hi riangwai kaom kasap ngai, nangni sannasik-ah kintho eii. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ajarchu kei'n khawa mun kahongtung phakhan kei'n nangni angme kinamin ezoot, halli nangni'n kei angme ningnamin ezoot kha eleiya, inteiya inleiminrilla kichi eii. Khawa khachu, insuol, kara-ot, araang kase, esik karatok, injakna khat-um mi chongkaril, in-or halli chongsuok raalsuok kei'n mucha tia kamalung adong. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Kei kahongpha, mi katam khat in matiangnga inleitho inthiangmak, zool-inthai khat-um inmani taksa manuomna inmanu ah inphut inmalung lakathuulmak ngai chungnga ka Pathian in nangni maikuungnga keihi innaminjaksik eii halli kamitrathi kahuuisik eii tia kei kachi.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Chongpe khat-um Chubei thona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Tuun kei'n nangni koolla kahongsik hi woithum huuina kha ejei, “Chongkasuok rakip sakhi inni emakli inthum murra chong rakip niminngirsik eii” tia chong inthiang khan aril. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Innidan 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char><verse eid="2CO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Mansakhet-ah manu katho ngai khat-um aleiilak rakip diang kei'n matiang kariljei, halli woini huuina kei'n kahonglai angnga, kei kalaak-ah kaom innum, kei tuun rilnook kate, tichu, kei'n woikhat inlet-ah kaheiwa inchu, tu-inkhat um rachaakleiya danuningjei. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Christa in kei diangnga iril rakip kha nangni'n incheenna musik ningmanuom kha ningmusik eii. Nangni le inruoiya chuon athopha, ama suolmak, khawa rathuulla, nangni karra ama ranak kha ama'n amalar. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ajarchu ama'n Cross chungnga thinasik katungnga akasuol ang innum, Pathian ranak khan aringjei, keini amale kin-inchun jarra keini um kinsuol; takkha nangnile ni-inchunna suungnga Pathian ama ringkhuo ranak khan amale inruoiya tum nichang suomsik ejei.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Nangni'n ngamna khan ningring jeibo ti ratokna sik-ah ningtheinuo ah in ensui inlang ningtheinuo ah chong intanru. Christa Jisu'n nangni suungnga i-om inthiangtak ah ningjetbe? Kha emak inchu nangni ningmasial theijei. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Eini akamasial emakmi ti nangni'n ningjet tihi kei'n kangamna. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Keini maika-ar kin eii ti malarna eleiya, nangni'n akatuun ningthothei nasik, keini akamasial kinpuo innum, nangni katuunmak minthomak nasik, Pathian diang kinnanipi eii. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ajarchu keini'n akatuun chungnga iteii thomatormung, takkha akatuun sikbit achu kinthothei. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ajarchu keini'n kinsuol phakhan keini kinrok takkha nangni chu ningraat. Halli nangni pui tungnasik keini innum kinnanipi eii. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Pumi'n kei diangnga inape thomatorna hi nangni koinasik emak ah, nangni inbooltharna sik kha eii. Khawa jarra ningkoolla kahong tungpha hiwa thomatorna hi kaneimanna nangni kase-ah kanathomak nasik, hiwahi nangni diangnga inphut kalaak-ah kaomlai kiheimajia eii.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Tuunchu, kasap ngai, chubei kanaheitho! puikatung ning enasik chuontak thoru; kachongril hi rangairu; inkhat li inkhat inruolru, halli malung kahoiya omru. Halli Pathian minriangna le malung kadai khan naompui rase.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Inthiangtak ah inzoop le inruoiya inkhat in inkhat kha chubei inthoru.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 13:12">Pathian mi rakip in nangnidiang chubei innaheitho.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Pumi Jisu Christa riangwai, Pathian minriangna, halli Ratha Inthiang naompuina khan ningraja-ah naompuichak rase.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>